OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Fspreading southeast during this
OL,7,Fmorning and early afternoon. Then
OL,8,Fturning drier but rain may linger
OL,9,Facross the Central Belt until later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.
OL,12,FThen the rest of the night will be dry
OL,13,Fwith variable amounts of cloud.
OL,14,FBecoming chilly in some sheltered
OL,15,Fglens.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FEarly brightness in the
OL,18,Fnorth otherwise a largely dry day but
OL,19,Fbecoming cloudy. Rain spreading
OL,20,Fnortheast in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
